        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"146e20d3-ab2e-44db-b904-1642e2efa93e\",\"review_text\":\"The recent update is the worse. You can't skip songs as you wish to listen. You can't fast forward. Uninstalling the app and searching an alternative. I would rather download songs online and listen on inbuilt music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e833c58a-b994-4783-b2bd-66c606304662\",\"review_text\":\"I bycot all sweeden applications\"},{\"review_id\":\"5a0736a7-95ca-4712-a787-c5e6189f3fc5\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this app 👎👎👎🏻👎🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"8def96a0-5cc4-4902-bb73-2bfd55556ed2\",\"review_text\":\"It's a amazing app that is all I can nice work Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"b89af4d0-85d6-469a-9279-d450464dbf7b\",\"review_text\":\"This give me best experience of listening music\"},{\"review_id\":\"09a50f21-eb7b-4e92-9590-ef03f1f01f54\",\"review_text\":\"Great 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"ea19cbb7-373b-4122-91be-3900e0dbe880\",\"review_text\":\"I should have pulled the trigger on this years ago.\"},{\"review_id\":\"727555ed-3c7c-4d7c-9138-5b54a1e073d8\",\"review_text\":\"Can you please bring back zee company Musics Or else we will force government to Ban spotify And Refund all our Money.😒😒. I will give you 1 week if you'll not add the songs we will 100% confirm that to ban with 100% Refund And the time starts now if you'll don't refund we will pay a pension of 10M dollars per 1 person who have purchased the premium.\"},{\"review_id\":\"35de0f96-c3dd-4dd1-afe0-e461f2f032fe\",\"review_text\":\"The most useless app I've ever seen You just can't login or sign in\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9c8ff07-1de7-4042-8e0a-f32b17634569\",\"review_text\":\"SPOTIFY IS MY LOVERR\"}]}"
